Hi, Jim.  I see you landed a *fun* summer job.  There was a relmon bug
in pl6.  Maybe the fix did not quite work.  The "dungeon collapses" is
a feature.  A save file was created for you with the extension ".e" or
".e.Z" (short for error) if you compress save files.  Remove the ".e"
from the name and you can play it.

Is anyone taking bets on whether the dev team will ever replace this
cutesy "dungeon collapse" message with an intelligeable error message?


